Package: vabaxos-setup
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nm-1.0, network-manager, gsettings-desktop-schemas
Recommends: orca, vabaxos-branding
Description: VabaxOS first setup
 A guided GTK 4 program for the first login (ADR-0014): high contrast,
 text size, zoom, pointer size, reduced motion; screen reader and voice
 speed, pitch and volume; keyboard layout, sticky, slow and bounce keys,
 screen keyboard, hover click; Wi-Fi networks. Every setting takes effect
 at once and every control has a name for screen readers.
